{"type":"text","timestamp":1784693008911,"sessionID":"ses_07813ae5affewXVPxSkMs6ShHp","part":{"id":"prt_f87fe25f7001MjFG7DHBFZictn","messageID":"msg_f87fe07c5001B5ctQSj7x4dao2","sessionID":"ses_07813ae5affewXVPxSkMs6ShHp","type":"text","text":"The same-class lexical sweep narrows F005 rather than creating a duplicate: `sk-code` and `system-deep-loop` both correctly defer on `\"preview...\"`, while `sk-doc` alone routes. The defect is therefore a confirmed per-hub matcher omission, not a fleet-wide boundary failure.","time":{"start":1784693007863,"end":1784693008909},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0b5188f3e2c86efb016a60410fd1e08191a986fded8c234389","phase":"commentary"}}}}
