{"type":"text","timestamp":1784694335985,"sessionID":"ses_07813ae5affewXVPxSkMs6ShHp","part":{"id":"prt_f88121c9b001akvIgVlSYQvABi","messageID":"msg_f8811ec5d001q7ekbeVyMWLKoh","sessionID":"ses_07813ae5affewXVPxSkMs6ShHp","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Execute the detached `deep-review` workflow for the compiled-coverage spec folder with exactly 10 iterations and synthesis.\n- Keep every write inside `review/lineages/sol-high`; on completion output `FANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:sol-high`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Session: `fanout-sol-high-1784691838667-iv78vk`; executor: `cli-opencode`, model `openai/gpt-5.6-sol-fast`.\n- Stop policy: `max-iterations`; convergence before iteration 10 is telemetry only.\n- Artifact root is pre-bound; do not run `resolveArtifactRoot`.\n- Target files are read-only. Graph upsert was skipped because it would write outside the lineage boundary.\n- Lineage lock is currently acquired at `.deep-review.lock` and must be released after synthesis.\n- Active findings: five P1 (`F001`, `F002`, `F003`, `F005`, `F007`) and two P2 (`F004`, `F006`).\n- Iteration 3 accidentally generated two synthetic findings from cumulative counts; iteration 4 resolved `SUMMARY-P1-001` and `SUMMARY-P1-002` and recorded a `state_repair` event.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Initialized config, JSONL state, registry, strategy, dashboard, prompts, deltas, and iteration files inside the lineage.\n- Completed and mechanically verified iterations 1–9; reducer replay succeeds with zero corruption.\n- `F001` P1: `refreshCanonicalManifest()` can overwrite concurrent serving-state changes.\n- `F002` P1: cutover gate false-passes compiled `clarify`/`reject` as legacy defer.\n- `F003` P1: packet claims completion while required P1 checks, sign-off, and planning metadata remain open.\n- `F004` P2: summary incorrectly claims no dedicated SD-015 test.\n- `F005` P1: `sk-doc` routes `\"preview this document\"` because `\"review\"` is substring-matched; legacy defers.\n- `F006` P2: benchmark telemetry still says unset cannot permit compiled after default-on cutover.\n- `F007` P1: manifest suite is 15/16; authored sync closure reports `UNRESOLVED: sk-code, system-deep-loop, mcp-tooling, sk-doc`.\n- Confirmed all seven promoted manifests are `compiled-serving` and fresh.\n- Confirmed fleet kill-switch: `SPECKIT_COMPILED_ROUTING=0` gives `flag-off` for all seven hubs.\n- Confirmed targeted parity tests pass 49/49, resolver copies are byte-identical, and frozen scorer hashes match pins.\n\n### Active\n- Iteration 10 final stabilization/adjudication pass: registry and all major P1 source lines were re-read, but prompt, iteration narrative, delta, and state event have not yet been written.\n- Current reducer state after iteration 9: `openFindingsCount: 7`, `resolvedFindingsCount: 2`, `corruptionCount: 0`.\n\n### Blocked\n- `node --test .opencode/bin/tests/compiled-route-manifest.test.cjs` fails 1 of 16 tests at `.opencode/bin/tests/compiled-route-manifest.test.cjs:378-411`.\n- Authored and promoted per-hub router bytes diverge; `compiled-route-sync.cjs` cannot regenerate the promoted runtime from its declared authored source.\n- Spec Memory trigger retrieval returned `Not connected`; repository evidence is the fallback.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write and verify iteration 10 with no new findings unless final adjudication changes severity; run the reducer and append the hard-ceiling stop event.\n2. Synthesize `review-report.md`, append terminal synthesis state, run strict packet validation, release `.deep-review.lock`, and output `FANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:sol-high`.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-sk-doc-router-alignment/020-router-unification-program/007-unified-refactor-implementation/015-routing-coverage-activation-verification/013-compiled-coverage-buildout/review/lineages/sol-high`: exclusive write boundary and review packet.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-sk-doc-router-alignment/020-router-unification-program/007-unified-refactor-implementation/015-routing-coverage-activation-verification/013-compiled-coverage-buildout/review/lineages/sol-high/deep-review-state.jsonl`: append-only workflow history.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-sk-doc-router-alignment/020-router-unification-program/007-unified-refactor-implementation/015-routing-coverage-activation-verification/013-compiled-coverage-buildout/review/lineages/sol-high/deep-review-findings-registry.json`: reducer-owned active/resolved findings.\n- `.opencode/bin/lib/compiled-route-manifest.cjs`: `F001`.\n- `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/skill-benchmark/cutover-playbook-executor.cjs`: `F002`.\n- `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-sk-doc-router-alignment/020-router-unification-program/007-unified-refactor-implementation/015-routing-coverage-activation-verification/013-compiled-coverage-buildout/checklist.md`: `F003`.\n- `.opencode/bin/lib/compiled-routing/006-parent-hub-rollout/007-sk-doc/lib/router.cjs`: `F005`.\n- `.opencode/bin/compiled-route-sync.cjs`: `F007` root cause and authored/promoted sync contract.\n- `.opencode/bin/tests/compiled-route-manifest.test.cjs`: failing verification gate.","time":{"start":1784694316187,"end":1784694335982},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_03663f9ba1183111016a60462c26c481918d28d02ebaa6f8a8","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
