{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784694425899,"sessionID":"ses_07813ae5affewXVPxSkMs6ShHp","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_0vRsa3aUGY9R5uvGZfxDrAJX","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"phase_main_loop|phase_synthesis|step_finalize|synthesis_complete|lock_released|emit_resource_map|reduce-state.cjs|append.*maxIterations|maxIterationsReached|step_increment","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml"},"output":"Found 100 matches (more matches available)\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-model-benchmark-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 105:     reducer: .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/shared/reduce-state.cjs\n\n  Line 200:         command: \"node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/shared/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder}/improvement\"\n\n  Line 219:   phase_synthesis:\n\n  Line 224:         command: \"node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/shared/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder}/improvement\"\n\n  Line 238:         append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"lock_released\",\"path\":\"{state_paths.lock_file}\",\"releasePhase\":\"synthesis\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:\n  Line 157:       After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n\n  Line 158:       phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n\n  Line 159:       phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n\n  Line 602:           append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"config_warning\",\"mode\":\"r