eep-ai-council-auto.yaml:\n  Line 146:   phase_synthesis:\n\n  Line 178:         append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"lock_released\",\"path\":\"{state_paths.lock_file}\",\"releasePhase\":\"save\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-alignment-auto.yaml:\n  Line 197:           skip_to: phase_synthesis\n\n  Line 541:         if_converged: { proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n\n  Line 542:         if_stop_max_iterations: { log: \"Max iterations ({max_iterations}) reached without full convergence; proceeding to synthesis with current coverage/stability as recorded evidence.\", proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n\n  Line 543:         if_nothing_to_converge: { log: \"Zero applicable lanes (every lane discovered zero artifacts, or none resolved) -- nothing to converge. Proceeding to synthesis.\", proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n\n  Line 549:   phase_synthesis:\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml:\n  Line 179:       After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n\n  Line 180:       phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n\n  Line 181:       phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n\n  Line 313:           skip_to: phase_synthesis\n\n  Line 590:              a) if iteration_count >= max_iterations: set decision = \"STOP\", stopReason = \"maxIterationsReached\", hard_stop_reason = \"max_iterations_reached\", preserve any failed legal-stop gates as terminal evidence, and proceed to synthesis without legal-stop veto\n\n  Line 593:              Operator stop reasons (`maxIterationsReached`, `manualStop`, `userPaused`, unrecoverable `error`) are terminal ceilings. They do not hide failed gates;