":\"event\",\"event\":\"lock_released\",\"path\":\"{state_paths.lock_file}\",\"releasePhase\":\"save\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-alignment-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 188:           skip_to: phase_synthesis\n\n  Line 415:         if_converged: { proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n\n  Line 416:         if_stop_max_iterations: { log: \"Max iterations ({max_iterations}) reached without full convergence; proceeding to synthesis with current coverage/stability as recorded evidence.\", proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n\n  Line 417:         if_nothing_to_converge: { log: \"Zero applicable lanes -- nothing to converge. Proceeding to synthesis.\", proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n\n  Line 423:   phase_synthesis:\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-model-benchmark-presentation.txt:\n  Line 303: 5. Check stop conditions (converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, manualStop, error, stuckRecovery)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-agent-improvement-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 100:     reducer: .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/shared/reduce-state.cjs\n\n  Line 270:         command: \"node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/shared/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder}/improvement\"\n\n  Line 292:   phase_synthesis:\n\n  Line 307:         append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"lock_released\",\"path\":\"{state_paths.lock_file}\",\"releasePhase\":\"synthesis\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-agent-improvement-presentation.txt:\n  Line 211: 6. Reduces evidence into a dimensional dashboard with convergence detection (per SKILL canonical stopReason enum: converged | maxIterationsReached | blockedStop | manualStop | error | stuckRecovery)\n\n  Line 212: 7. Stops on canonical stopReason: `converged`, `maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `manualStop`, `error`, or `stuckRecovery`\n\n  Line 284: 7. Check stop conditions (converged via legal-stop bundle, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, manualStop, error, stuckRecovery)\n\n  Line 317: - `maxIterationsReached` — Hit `max_iterations` limit\n\n  Line 450: - **Stop-reason enum** (post-060/005): canonical values are `converged | maxIterationsReached | blockedStop | manualStop | error | stuckRecovery`. Old `plateau`/`benchmarkPlateau` retired.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt:\n  Line 90: **Stop policy:** `stop_policy=convergence` preserves normal deep-review behavior: legal convergence may stop before `maxIterations`. `stop_policy=max-iterations` makes convergence signals telemetry-only until the iteration ceiling; before `maxIterations`, broaden the next angle instead of synthesizing. Terminal manual pause, user stop, unrecoverable error, and `maxIterationsReached` still stop.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/compiled/deep-review.contract.md:\n  Line 233: **Stop policy:** `stop_policy=convergence` preserves normal deep-review behavior: legal convergence may stop before `maxIterations`. `stop_policy=max-iterations` makes convergence signals telemetry-only until the iteration ceiling; before `maxIterations`, broaden the next angle instead of synthesizing. Terminal manual pause, user stop, unrecoverable error, and `maxIterationsReached` still stop.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 171:       After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n\n  Line 172:       phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n\n  Line 173:       phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n\n  Line 535:           1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap bypasses quality-guard overrides; record failed guards/blockers as synthesis evidence instead of continuing.\n\n  Line 573:           6. if decision == \"STOP\" and reason != \"maxIterationsReached\":\n\n  Line 613:               excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, minIterationsNotReached, error, manualStop, userPaused]\n\n  Line 772:               step_finalize_divergent_pivot:\n\n  Line 817:                     command: \"node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder}\"\n\n  Line 850:                     command: \"node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder}\"\n\n  Line 877:         stop_reasons_enum: [converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused]\n\n  Line 1055:         command: \"node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder}\"\n\n  Line 1159:   phase_synthesis:\n\n  Line 1195:           - reason: \"Use the latest synthesis/recovery stop reason if present, else the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused.)\"\n\n  Line 1225:       step_emit_resource_map:\n\n  Line 1228:         dry_run_halt_event: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"dry_run_halt\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"boundary\":\"reducer-refresh\",\"step\":\"step_emit_resource_map\",\"detail\":\"The reducer would emit resource-map output.\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n\n  Line 1229:         command: \"node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map\"\n\n  Line 1274:         append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"totalIterations\":{iteration_count},\"answeredCount\":{answered_count},\"totalQuestions\":{total_questions},\"stopReason\":\"{reason}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n\n  Line 1393:         append_to_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"lock_released\",\"path\":\"{state_paths.lock_file}\",\"releasePhase\":\"save\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 142:       After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n\n\n(Results truncated. Consider using a more specific path or pattern.)","metadata":{"matches":100,"truncated":true},"title":"phase_main_loop|phase_synthesis|step_finalize|synthesis_complete|lock_released|emit_resource_map|reduce-state.cjs|append.*maxIterations|maxIterationsReached|step_increment","time":{"start":1784694425850,"end":1784694425896}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0f48f9f6c07bf118016a6046974b348191aebf25bb5ddffbb7"}},"id":"prt_f8813c7e1001oX5YD6xpAplrXF","sessionID":"ses_07813ae5affewXVPxSkMs6ShHp","messageID":"msg_f8813ac21001dzvfxtOmDGe0CT"}}
